{
    "title": "Weather",
    "description": "Hyperlocal weather forecasts are here to help you own the day! Trusted by 100 Million+ users across the world, the Weather app by Swish will keep you weather-ready, every day.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features</b>\r\n\u271310 Day weather forecast\r\n\u271348 hours rain forecast\r\n\u2713Multi-layer radar maps\r\n\u271310+ customizable widgets\r\n\u2713Air quality info\r\n\u2713Sun and Moon Tracker\r\n\r\n<b>Accurate Forecasts</b>\r\nMinute-by-minute forecast and precipitation up to 48 hours. Plan your days in advance with our 10 Day forecast.\r\n\r\n<b>Radar Map</b>\r\nMultiple weather layers and future radar maps to track thunderstorms, typhoons, hurricanes, rainfall, snowfall and more.\r\n\r\n<b>Detailed Weather Info</b>\r\nMore than 15 weather data points that give you all the information you need. UV index, dew point, visibility, humidity, wind speed, atmospheric pressure & more.\r\n\r\n<b>Health Center</b>\r\nEnjoy the outdoors with details about wind chill, moisture, air pollution level, and pollen count.\r\nAir Quality Index: Get real-time air quality info for your area and plan accordingly.\r\nAllergy outlook: Track grass, weed, and tree pollen.\r\nPollution level: Check pollutant levels of PM10, PM2.5, O3, CO, NO2 and SO2\r\nHealth tips: Get advice for general health and sensitive groups.\r\n\r\n<b>Beautiful Weather Widgets</b>\r\nWe want you to see the weather your way. Choose from 1x1 widget, 2x1, 2x2, 2x3, 3x4, 4x1 widget, 4x2, 4x3, 5x1 widget, & 5x2 widget sizes in preferred formats.\r\n\r\n<b>Sun and Moon Tracker</b>\r\nPlan your day or night activities with sunrise, sunset, moonrise, and moonset. Explore various moon phases, including New Moon and Full Moon.\r\n\r\n<b>Additional features</b>\r\nCustomizable Units: Personalize your weather experience by customizing units to your preference.\r\nMultilingual Support: Choose from multiple languages to make the app more accessible to you.\r\nDark and Light Themes: Customize your app's appearance with dark and light themes to suit your preferences and reduce eye strain in low-light conditions.\r\n\r\n100 million downloads and counting! Download the best android weather app now.\r\n\r\nNeed help? Feel free to contact us at oneweather@onelouder.com. We would love to hear from you.\r\n\r\nNote: We may collect information from your use of the app that we may share with our partners to deliver personalized ads and improve our services. You may modify your choices at any time as explained in our Privacy Policy: https://1weatherapp.com/privacy/#rights.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hyperlocal weather forecasts are here to help you own the day! Trusted by 100 Million+ users across the world, the Weather app by Swish will keep you weather-ready, every day.<br><br><b>Key Features</b><br>\u271310 Day weather forecast<br>\u271348 hours rain forecast<br>\u2713Multi-layer radar maps<br>\u271310+ customizable widgets<br>\u2713Air quality info<br>\u2713Sun and Moon Tracker<br><br><b>Accurate Forecasts</b><br>Minute-by-minute forecast and precipitation up to 48 hours. Plan your days in advance with our 10 Day forecast.<br><br><b>Radar Map</b><br>Multiple weather layers and future radar maps to track thunderstorms, typhoons, hurricanes, rainfall, snowfall and more.<br><br><b>Detailed Weather Info</b><br>More than 15 weather data points that give you all the information you need. UV index, dew point, visibility, humidity, wind speed, atmospheric pressure &amp; more.<br><br><b>Health Center</b><br>Enjoy the outdoors with details about wind chill, moisture, air pollution level, and pollen count.<br>Air Quality Index: Get real-time air quality info for your area and plan accordingly.<br>Allergy outlook: Track grass, weed, and tree pollen.<br>Pollution level: Check pollutant levels of PM10, PM2.5, O3, CO, NO2 and SO2<br>Health tips: Get advice for general health and sensitive groups.<br><br><b>Beautiful Weather Widgets</b><br>We want you to see the weather your way. Choose from 1x1 widget, 2x1, 2x2, 2x3, 3x4, 4x1 widget, 4x2, 4x3, 5x1 widget, &amp; 5x2 widget sizes in preferred formats.<br><br><b>Sun and Moon Tracker</b><br>Plan your day or night activities with sunrise, sunset, moonrise, and moonset. Explore various moon phases, including New Moon and Full Moon.<br><br><b>Additional features</b><br>Customizable Units: Personalize your weather experience by customizing units to your preference.<br>Multilingual Support: Choose from multiple languages to make the app more accessible to you.<br>Dark and Light Themes: Customize your app&#39;s appearance with dark and light themes to suit your preferences and reduce eye strain in low-light conditions.<br><br>100 million downloads and counting! Download the best android weather app now.<br><br>Need help? Feel free to contact us at oneweather@onelouder.com. We would love to hear from you.<br><br>Note: We may collect information from your use of the app that we may share with our partners to deliver personalized ads and improve our services. You may modify your choices at any time as explained in our Privacy Policy: https://1weatherapp.com/privacy/#rights.",
